Creating a video chat application involves using WebRTC (Web Real-Time Communication) technology, which allows direct peer-to-peer communication between web browsers. To create a video chat application using Node.js, you can use Socket.IO to facilitate the signaling server and express for handling HTTP requests. Here's a simple example to get you started:

1. First, initialize a new Node.js project and install the required dependencies:

```bash
